{"t":"VLTO","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Veralto Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Pollution & Treatment Controls","employees":17000,"hq":"Waltham, MA, United States","website":"https://www.veralto.com","summary_en":"Veralto Corporation provides water analytics, water treatment, marking and coding, and packaging and color solutions worldwide. It operates through two segments, Water Quality (WQ) and Product Quality & Innovation (PQI). The WQ segment offers precision instrumentation and water treatment technologies to measure, analyze, and treat water in residential, commercial, municipal, industrial, research, and natural resource applications under the Hach, Trojan Technologies, ChemTreat, and other brands. This segment also provides water solutions, including chemical reagents, services, and software solutions. The PQI segment offers marking and coding for packaged goods and related consumables; a software solution that provides digital asset management, marketing resource management, and product information management; inline printing solutions for products and packaging with marking and coding systems; design software and imaging systems for the creation of new packaging designs; color management solutions for printed packages and consumer and industrial products; and color standard services for the design industry. This segment sells its products and services through the Videojet, Linx, Esko, X-Rite, and Pantone brands. The company serves industries, such as municipal utilities, food and beverage, pharmaceutical, and industrials. The company was formerly known as DH EAS Holding Corp. and changed its name to Veralto Corporation in February 2023. Veralto Corporation was incorporated in 2022 and is headquartered in Waltham, Massachusetts.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Veralto Corporation은 전 세계적으로 물 분석, 수처리, 마킹 및 코딩, 포장 및 색상 솔루션을 제공합니다. WQ(수질)와 PQI(제품 품질 및 혁신)라는 두 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. WQ 부문은 Hach, Trojan Technologies, ChemTreat 및 기타 브랜드의 주거용, 상업용, 도시용, 산업용, 연구용 및 천연 자원 응용 분야에서 물을 측정, 분석 및 처리하기 위한 정밀 계측 및 수처리 기술을 제공합니다. 이 부문은 화학 시약, 서비스 및 소프트웨어 솔루션을 포함한 물 솔루션도 제공합니다. PQI 부문은 포장 상품 및 관련 소모품에 대한 마킹 및 코딩을 제공합니다. 디지털 자산 관리, 마케팅 자원 관리, 제품 정보 관리를 제공하는 소프트웨어 솔루션; 마킹 및 코딩 시스템을 갖춘 제품 및 포장용 인라인 인쇄 솔루션; 새로운 포장 디자인 제작을 위한 디자인 소프트웨어 및 이미징 시스템; 인쇄된 패키지와 소비자 및 산업용 제품을 위한 색상 관리 솔루션; 디자인 산업을 위한 컬러 표준 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 부문은 Videojet, Linx, Esko, X-Rite 및 Pantone 브랜드를 통해 제품과 서비스를 판매합니다. 이 회사는 지방자치단체, 식품 및 음료, 제약, 산업재 등의 산업에 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 DH EAS Holding Corp.로 알려졌으며 2023년 2월에 Veralto Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. Veralto Corporation은 2022년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠주 월섬에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":116.55,"mcap":28338180096.0,"pe":28.920595,"fpe":23.894705,"peg":2.7538,"ps":4.885051,"pb":8.780323,"ev_ebitda":22.017,"div":0.45,"beta":0.666,"hi52":119.025,"lo52":80.03},"fin":{"rev":5800999936.0,"rev_g":0.075,"eps_g":0.084,"gross":0.59835,"op":0.19417,"net":0.17273001,"roe":0.32961,"fcf":763374976.0,"cash":1784999936.0,"debt":3124999936.0,"de":96.689,"eps":4.03,"feps":4.87765},"own":{"short":0.028499998,"inst":1.02406,"insider":0.0019},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":124.625,"median":127.0,"high":135.0,"low":100.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.82353,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":9,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":8,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":129.0,"priorPriceTarget":117.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":120.0,"priorPriceTarget":107.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":